{
  "an5.176:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 5.176 ",
  "an5.176:0.2": "18. Upāsakavagga ",
  "an5.176:0.3": "Pītisutta ",
  "an5.176:1.1": "Atha kho anāthapiṇḍiko gahapati pañcamattehi upāsakasatehi parivuto yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho anāthapiṇḍikaṁ gahapatiṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "an5.176:2.1": "“Tumhe kho, gahapati, bhikkhusaṅghaṁ paccupaṭṭhitā cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhārena. ",
  "an5.176:2.2": "Na kho, gahapati, tāvatakeneva tuṭṭhi karaṇīyā: ",
  "an5.176:2.3": "‘mayaṁ bhikkhusaṅghaṁ paccupaṭṭhitā cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhārenā’ti. ",
  "an5.176:2.4": "Tasmātiha, gahapati, evaṁ sikkhitabbaṁ: ",
  "an5.176:2.5": "‘kinti mayaṁ kālena kālaṁ pavivekaṁ pītiṁ upasampajja vihareyyāmā’ti. ",
  "an5.176:2.6": "Evañhi vo, gahapati, sikkhitabban”ti. ",
  "an5.176:3.1": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā sāriputto bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an5.176:3.2": "“acchariyaṁ, bhante, abbhutaṁ, bhante. ",
  "an5.176:3.3": "Yāva subhāsitañcidaṁ, bhante, bhagavatā: ",
  "an5.176:3.4": "‘tumhe kho, gahapati, bhikkhusaṅghaṁ paccupaṭṭhitā cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhārena. ",
  "an5.176:3.5": "Na kho, gahapati, tāvatakeneva tuṭṭhi karaṇīyā—",
  "an5.176:3.6": "mayaṁ bhikkhusaṅghaṁ paccupaṭṭhitā cīvarapiṇḍapātasen�